            <div xml:id="m-8f9af922-e456-423a-841f-ef5da8638596">
              <lg xml:id="m-a4dd301f-861b-41ab-8378-8fbbd7453515">
                <l xml:id="m-089b812d-e239-4541-a4ac-a65d403ca405" facs="#m-9a9f40a6-2d85-43c6-91d5-b44fd58adc03" label="ambiguous">1030</l><l xml:id="m-5bd6c427-9a05-42bb-905e-6c1eac373a4a" facs="#m-919ae60e-5934-4cd9-9a86-ff9624401f19" label="text-like">12th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-25d8b7f0-ce38-46e5-b171-73b0b33768ac" facs="#m-130beaa1-da9c-49c8-ae08-45bc1e283782" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 1o. a.</l><l xml:id="m-aa113a12-f9e4-4634-b766-f1fff331963e" facs="#m-9b4f6b56-7c60-4edb-b9df-c30c2af347bf" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus di-lin latrónes, qui étiam despoliavé¬</l><l xml:id="m-329a50f8-96dc-45e3-bfd6-14270c11b49b" facs="#m-75a2ff00-ea71-4919-9357-53a7ec4171b8" label="lyrics-like">I scipulis suis: Beáti óculi, qui lrunt eum: et plagis impósitis abié¬</l><l xml:id="m-49e52b70-eb49-40f1-ab0b-ac722a4ce257" facs="#m-e7bd2b99-6abf-4105-bcc3-c693fcc8b882" label="lyrics-like">vident quae vos vidétis. Dico enim</l><l xml:id="m-0c5676c8-3768-4475-88f6-e9145ee59563" facs="#m-959c015e-cdf5-4e73-a688-4d5c1fb27c18" label="ambiguous">runt, semivivo relicto. Accidit au¬</l><l xml:id="m-de005b58-948b-4cb1-bb82-7955d5b3c534" facs="#m-14c72991-34ff-4e4a-adc2-9eb8e137f7c0" label="lyrics-like">vobis, quod multi prophétae et re¬</l><l xml:id="m-ad835386-bd8c-4d3b-ad5b-5444985c9e74" facs="#m-25d9e573-f8e2-477e-aa10-0398a8c9376b" label="lyrics-like">tem, ut sacérdos quidam descénde¬</l><l xml:id="m-c5fb90f0-8488-46f7-8f68-6b7a7453e0b0" facs="#m-c155ea42-4ffe-4f4e-9312-d5612f31505e" label="lyrics-like">ges voluérunt vidére quae vos vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-8b1f1646-f07d-4825-8dbe-6e3ab890e930" facs="#m-04bb1cfd-1c4a-470a-bacb-5df3d8219fe4" label="lyrics-like">ret eádem via: et viso illo, prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-edcc5c1e-ae3c-4ffa-9c62-20459316699e" facs="#m-50de4657-0010-46d2-a543-2856513e4e34" label="lyrics-like">détis, et non vidérunt; et audire</l><l xml:id="m-f7d9a12e-f589-483b-abe2-99c30a23a4e9" facs="#m-2b4160fd-9c18-49ca-8e8f-c9480292ea83" label="ambiguous">tersvit. Similiter et Levita, cum esset</l><l xml:id="m-2039d264-5f8f-4fa8-8015-89527641d442" facs="#m-032f5035-b9ba-4957-abae-8c0ab31d15ee" label="lyrics-like">quae audítis, et non audiérunt. Et</l><l xml:id="m-86f7b3d8-a401-4f9c-9e4f-2619ae70e8a3" facs="#m-f6010c37-ce4f-4aac-baa2-2a9248f4f238" label="lyrics-like">secus locum, et vidéret eum, per¬</l><l xml:id="m-64535db2-f7db-4cf9-b91d-4f5887c03a62" facs="#m-1bea8cd0-c6b1-47fd-9353-af11d3c7fa60" label="lyrics-like">tránsiit. Samaritánus autem quidam</l><l xml:id="m-2e06933d-ba35-4e24-ba90-2b61f6f4aa96" facs="#m-2d27d0a0-85a0-4ea9-bf13-f2df49d802fe" label="lyrics-like">ecce quidam Legisperitus surréxit,</l><l xml:id="m-7ba8e190-7a94-46ee-aca2-64009c8eb4a5" facs="#m-cf87e6b6-91a4-42d9-943c-17713f1c9a2f" label="ambiguous">tentans illum. et dicens: Magister,</l><l xml:id="m-d07f37ca-7449-4671-b1c1-09a087e314a8" facs="#m-d20874a1-0ac7-4e6d-9d6c-559e0e137e4c" label="lyrics-like">iter fáciens, venit secus eum: et</l><l xml:id="m-8fcff1bd-d4db-426c-b025-5410d4ca1ac5" facs="#m-41f4e425-099d-40d4-8c07-42ec960f6aec" label="lyrics-like">quid faciéndo vitam aetérnam pos¬</l><l xml:id="m-7fafb704-cf66-4e07-9b1a-e481ba122d6e" facs="#m-2eb0c6d3-7ec8-4de1-9d6b-fc255e19505c" label="lyrics-like">videns eum, misericórdia motus est.</l><l xml:id="m-2e9c6ba2-5fcc-4b30-b852-d90f8668cf1c" facs="#m-3ee2bac5-93ac-4f82-89d2-36299bd190bb" label="lyrics-like">sidébo? At ille dixit ad eum: In</l><l xml:id="m-508fa591-1086-4d25-8875-e40b33da4a3a" facs="#m-b4c4e857-a18c-47b9-bca6-70ac928e4530" label="lyrics-like">Et apprópians, alligávit vúlnera</l><l xml:id="m-ca9f8239-aea1-4dca-83b1-36d799ddb6d5" facs="#m-1ccd0005-7b34-44d4-a7a3-97416e5f2b1d" label="lyrics-like">lege quid scriptum est? quómodo</l><l xml:id="m-b368814f-75d9-42d9-a31e-30bb40da16b9" facs="#m-0e19357b-0903-4ea1-b893-d65e02989585" label="lyrics-like">ejus, infúndens óleum et vinum: et</l><l xml:id="m-861aa7cc-99ef-4c77-85eb-796b7fafd255" facs="#m-6095af7c-11d9-4acc-b00b-8fd6827dc385" label="lyrics-like">legis? Ille respóndens dixit : Dfli¬</l><l xml:id="m-f78891ff-a45b-4f06-a723-61b53aff4531" facs="#m-ac63b506-b61a-47e1-baa1-aced5f84a96c" label="lyrics-like">impónens illum in juméntum suum,</l><l xml:id="m-2a9a9c4a-6436-4dad-a396-a31aa1cb9948" facs="#m-e5d29696-d1d7-44c3-8ecb-faf59764e412" label="lyrics-like">duxit in stábulum, et curam ejus</l><l xml:id="m-faa67dde-e777-4958-b216-7ea10175736a" facs="#m-8be194de-6f10-44f5-a7e3-98d7e8e08e6e" label="lyrics-like">ges Dóminum Deum tuum ex toto</l><l xml:id="m-3ac85a2e-2ed7-4f80-b546-1efc77557fb7" facs="#m-73eb753c-240e-4d8d-94e3-c975f8f6c220" label="lyrics-like">egit. Et áltera die prótulit duos de¬</l><l xml:id="m-3c1a4756-ef34-474d-ba63-faa2fabfeb75" facs="#m-8b243eee-c1a1-4ff6-9689-1bde2bc5dcf5" label="lyrics-like">corde tuo, et ex tota ánima tua, et</l><l xml:id="m-2b718741-a004-46df-8d15-af0adcdf0a3b" facs="#m-ead26d3c-49df-47d0-9a2e-b0940030e177" label="lyrics-like">nários, et dedit stabulário, et ait:</l><l xml:id="m-e033d219-2d9e-4f63-abcf-5a0250bdfbd0" facs="#m-756695e9-09d8-4da0-b89b-6d1b9317c18c" label="lyrics-like">ex ómnibus viribus tuis, et ex omni</l><l xml:id="m-7aa20851-1aa5-4f7d-97be-98e392eec87c" facs="#m-ffcccb2d-fb89-439a-acb3-8df7ff36f13f" label="lyrics-like">Curam illius habe: et quodcúmque</l><l xml:id="m-811febb1-8e40-4c6e-9131-48958ca037b1" facs="#m-84df02ee-86cf-44e0-8bc7-f16548fbb2d7" label="lyrics-like">mente tua: et próximum tuum sicut</l><l xml:id="m-5b7547bf-ac53-4cf4-8d5a-055b3718887b" facs="#m-149fe7c9-cc91-401b-938f-ac9cf405247e" label="ambiguous">tespsum. Dixitque illi: Recte re¬</l><l xml:id="m-fb3e4878-1ef9-4d7e-ae3c-ad95eccc7e90" facs="#m-60909c85-301b-4b4e-afba-b628b9c64c11" label="lyrics-like">supererogáveris, ego cum redíero,</l><l xml:id="m-d19a9382-94ba-47ea-8fb0-9159effbb2c0" facs="#m-f5d72f4f-63e4-45e2-b3d2-430d7fbefe92" label="lyrics-like">spondísti: hoc fac, et vives. Ille</l><l xml:id="m-519b9b7e-fdad-4ba2-b2fe-9787ad9b1379" facs="#m-cb27dd92-bb32-4abe-be85-6c04eb66cb9c" label="ambiguous">reddam tibi. Quis horum trium vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-c89cb270-20a3-4654-9f7f-080797bd7c0d" facs="#m-2ae07648-efed-4829-bd0c-7bd7d66c938b" label="lyrics-like">détur tibi próximus fuisse illi, qui</l><l xml:id="m-0033378c-9db0-420a-8a1a-5a78b5e9a657" facs="#m-b605273f-da44-4db7-b41a-04de1d97470a" label="lyrics-like">autem volens justificare seípsum,</l><l xml:id="m-c47e6623-876b-4fa0-8dcc-31bf488caa9b" facs="#m-0ac15d7f-0957-4231-8671-a8ccf3ed79cb" label="lyrics-like">dixit ad Jesum: Et quis est meus incidit in latrónes? At ille dixit:</l><l xml:id="m-983442c2-ed6e-4380-880b-b476572c1619" facs="#m-090be36b-a0e4-479d-9777-c7942905033f" label="lyrics-like">Qui fecit misericórdiam in illum. Et</l><l xml:id="m-18f9a3ae-dc01-46d6-85aa-b49d693c02ae" facs="#m-e44eaab9-7fa3-4ed4-92d2-1faa594f0fad" label="lyrics-like">próximus? Suscípiens autem Jesus,</l><l xml:id="m-48cb609d-0767-44a6-bf4e-da9a1fe4d141" facs="#m-f448d208-008a-4567-b650-e9051c7d0049" label="lyrics-like">dixit : Homo quidam descendébat! ait illi Jesus : Vade, et tu fac simí¬</l><l xml:id="m-8c7f26b7-c1d5-4cac-a747-67e6c2b5e088" facs="#m-2310e66b-89bb-40fe-baf2-e0aa8a935edf" label="lyrics-like">ab Jerúsalem in Jéricho, et incidit! liter.</l><l xml:id="m-de7c416a-8cce-4f82-b3f1-377d414b550b" facs="#m-916ed5f5-eabf-48a2-9363-5bf5cee8d82a" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-46b3713f-8eaa-4e38-bd51-00c90b2d10af" facs="#m-648cea6c-9455-42f4-96f9-0497d39a30d6" label="ambiguous">ofert.E</l><l xml:id="m-bd51f71f-8e5a-4f1c-a2e2-593ac9cc804e" facs="#m-0e75edd6-284d-418d-b40d-ace65609471a" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-a1145742-3cda-4c5c-a4f7-53f29ae63c72" facs="#m-3e89cca8-b013-4fad-836b-86de80eb01c8" label="ambiguous">----</l><l xml:id="m-6005a5f3-1939-4a48-a09e-9448c1d98099" facs="#m-2838649b-0c58-4bf4-ab16-8c52e716a8ac" label="lyrics-like">Recá-tus est “Mó-yses</l><l xml:id="m-0cb0f4a1-97ee-45d4-8081-86bd1a43ef62" facs="#m-15564cf3-a382-42d3-986b-3bf6f234a1b5" label="lyrics-like">in conspéctu</l><l xml:id="m-b3fbb85e-cbcf-4b88-a797-b8e1a0ed8e02" facs="#m-67f76884-f02b-446b-832e-1087d99426e4" label="lyrics-like">Dó- mi- ni Dé-i sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-7983ff63-66b4-41ee-b2cb-ae88337653bf" facs="#m-b0216238-45ad-468a-9b21-51a33ff4c744" label="ambiguous">xit.</l><l xml:id="m-8ec5c368-5f3b-4ec6-b199-6923d93fa82e" facs="#m-bbdff720-c3c8-4b2b-8cec-c9240bbba042" label="lyrics-like">et dí¬</l><l xml:id="m-c2efe3bf-30b4-4f82-84ee-7ec54702a090" facs="#m-348a24f2-80df-4f1c-8029-60c5b74625b8" label="ambiguous">i</l><l xml:id="m-647c7b26-dcf7-433d-8494-eb1f400faabc" facs="#m-e02aa535-8943-47b6-8880-c0e6ed0d904d" label="ambiguous">-4- -4-</l><l xml:id="m-cd35d2d4-a54c-4060-a1c8-70c31b02cc3b" facs="#m-296d3c40-9e77-4320-a80e-5725b73e14f5" label="lyrics-like">Precá¬ tus est Mó-yses</l><l xml:id="m-79fb3685-480b-4192-b3b3-a1fc0e5bf997" facs="#m-d7365f14-63bb-4677-969f-d4d477138212" label="lyrics-like">in conspéctu Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-5c6c7c23-3756-4f6c-b94f-952cd87ea881" facs="#m-ba7b7be7-23e1-4a65-bf2e-8c374a17a1bc" label="lyrics-like">xit: Qua-re, Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb8d3b9e-1516-4ebf-87ee-c9558fdb574e" facs="#m-10e72348-e708-4ec5-9cef-4d96930b4f4c" label="lyrics-like">et dí¬</l><l xml:id="m-502353b2-4ef0-44d8-883e-400139cf234a" facs="#m-ddb6308e-c808-41b4-b678-e4ad7579c3bf" label="lyrics-like">mi- ni Dé-i sú¬</l><l xml:id="m-06fb448a-22fd-4289-b708-bf1ba1c164e9" facs="#m-d98a9424-d346-49f4-aeb0-89fdda217b1e" label="ambiguous">i</l><l xml:id="m-9438d351-9f77-4610-8949-9ca431a5f530" facs="#m-f7572662-420e-4e03-b1f6-1e6831e5cf0c" label="lyrics-like">i-rá¬</l><l xml:id="m-7e2c8a46-e3a6-494b-bbdf-1e8d4312a55f" facs="#m-41605406-e021-4836-81a1-15d5ff7cb275" label="lyrics-like">sce-ris in pó- pulo tú¬ o?</l><l xml:id="m-344c441c-19de-43f4-94f3-6fd2dce194cf" facs="#m-74398b18-13bd-4230-a058-1ef9883862ef" label="ambiguous">mi- ne,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
